+              <h1> B4-1.3-06,  Property Condition and Quality of Construction of the Improvements (06/04/2025)</h1>
+            </div>
+            
+
+              
+            <div>
+              <div class="hidden-nid" data-this-nid='N3991'></div>
+              
+  <div>
+    <div class="guidepl-h4">Introduction</div>
+              <div>This topic contains information on property condition and quality of construction, including:</div>
+          </div>
+
+                                            <ul class="toc">
+                                      <li><a href="#P3796">Appraiser Selection of Condition, Quality, and other Characteristic Ratings</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P3801">Property Condition</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P3806">Property Condition Ratings</a></li>
