+                                      <li><a href="#P3826">Quality of Construction Rating</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P3831">Identifying Quality of Construction</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P3836">Physical Deficiencies That Affect Safety, Soundness, or Structural Integrity of the Subject Property</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P3841">Infestation, Dampness, or Settlement</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P13241">Uniform Appraisal Dataset (UAD) 3.6 Policy</a></li>
+                                  </ul>
+                <hr>
